@* The same explanation under the team report and under a player's own numbers *@
<div class="card mt-4">
    <div class="card-header">How it is measured</div>
    <div class="card-body small">
        <ul class="mb-2">
            <li><strong>Signed in</strong> runs from each sign-in to the last thing done on the site. A sign-in ends by signing out, or by itself after 30 minutes without activity.</li>
            <li><strong>Film</strong> counts only while a shared film is playing in the tab the player is looking at. It stops when the video is paused or the tab is hidden.</li>
            <li><strong>Playbook</strong> counts only while a playbook page is in front of the player and they are using it. It stops after a minute without activity or when the tab is hidden.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mb-0 text-muted">
            A week runs from Monday to Sunday, and time belongs to the week it started in. Having two tabs open does not count the same minute twice.
            There are no deadlines and nothing to complete: these numbers show activity, not proof of learning.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>
